  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups heavy whipping cream",
    "1.125 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup half-and-half cream",
    "3 tablespoons grated lemon zest",
    "5 large egg yolks",
    "0.75 cup fresh lemon juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bOeTW-R-_YKnjSpO-FuMtPPJZ9Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-01-50c0d5b65ac946eba5e5fa1ce68740fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine heavy cream, sugar, half-and-half, and lemon zest in a saucepan; bring to a simmer over low heat. Cook and stir until sugar is dissolved, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat, cover the saucepan, and allow to steep for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3wGCDrBTQJhDcmtHbiSFAXdaX0g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-02-08e0510e53ac461f8270c90d53ba5c61.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uncover the saucepan and bring back to a simmer over low heat. Beat egg yolks in a medium bowl. Gradually whisk 1 cup hot cream mixture into eggs, several tablespoons at a time. (This brings eggs up to temperature without scrambling them.)",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PSAOOMlacttmzwC-1kpZ5B2_rcY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-03-92311ba8ad5c4c43884f685658d11b1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir egg mixture back into cream mixture in the saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nRmUob2xnkHgEyu24W_yWK5XSNk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-04-c4947680ccc94b4a961d4206d579fa34.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir over low heat until mixture coats the back of a spoon, 5 to 10 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl; cover and refrigerate 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iqIFvNLAIoAAjMzZ-pl7oV5PkF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-05-7d427474323540c5979f9c26a5595ffc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir lemon juice into chilled ice cream mixture. Freeze in a 4- to 5-quart ice cream maker according to manufacturer's directions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xW34CD_wlNcr2r0zlXSEESPozso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-06-67723342a2da4e05a1b3f83b88a24dd5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer ice cream to a lidded freezer container, then freeze for about 4 hours to ripen flavors before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bFGebTXmemS31DHHlI1iHbK7jf0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-218156-super-lemon-ice-cream-VAT-step-07-151ad8e5c439491cab0679923b7c46bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218156/step_07.webp"
    }
